{"id":"n69518-14-6","stage":0,"title":"오르다 · 沾上","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69518-14-6-1","ko":"정 씨는 왜 저렇게 몸을 긁어요?","zh":"郑先生为什么一直抓身上？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정","meaning":"郑（姓氏）","explanation":"정：郑（姓氏）","readings":[{"term":"정","audio":"/audio/8fa8cd9c440be61d0151.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정","audio":"/audio/8fa8cd9c440be61d0151.mp3"}},{"text":"씨는","meaning":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","explanation":"씨：用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58145","senseId":"1","lemma":"씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"씨는","audio":"/audio/1e98662e92cdd5672d9e.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"저렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"저렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"저렇다","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71226","senseId":"1","lemma":"저렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저렇게","audio":"/audio/3e51b4147d3689f85089.mp3"}},{"text":"몸을","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몸을","audio":"/audio/384974e1d9816572ab28.mp3"}},{"text":"긁어요?","meaning":"挠，搔","explanation":"긁다：挠，搔；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"긁다","audio":"/audio/0f3e5518b947e9da0fa9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37194","senseId":"1","lemma":"긁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"긁어요","audio":"/audio/8b7ff7be2b3188fecfd0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c90eea3c6347f1e0","term":"씨","zh":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3","entryId":"58145","definition":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","pronunciation":["씨"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"07e99c1628a5077b","term":"저렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3","entryId":"71226","definition":"性质、模样、状态等与那个一样。","pronunciation":["저러타"]},{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"0f3e5518b947e9da","term":"긁다","zh":"挠，搔","audio":"/audio/0f3e5518b947e9da0fa9.mp3","entryId":"37194","definition":"用指甲或锋利的物体揉搓。","pronunciation":["극따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a7bfa4cd63e784509dab.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69518-14-6-2","ko":"옴이 올라서 그래요.","zh":"因为长了疥疮。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"옴이","meaning":"疥疮","explanation":"옴：疥疮；이：主格助词。옴이 오르다 表示染上疥疮；这里不是 오다 的名词化。","readings":[{"term":"옴","audio":"/audio/2c4f295da9900c3cfd31.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68473","senseId":"1","lemma":"옴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옴이","audio":"/audio/8917bfd15b4a6eff4871.mp3"}},{"text":"올라서","meaning":"沾上，染上","explanation":"오르다：沾上，染上；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"오르다","audio":"/audio/8fdeb9822b3fa0617051.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69518","senseId":"14","lemma":"오르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올라서","audio":"/audio/78febc91551e34c815d8.mp3"}},{"text":"그래요.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래요","audio":"/audio/b6894238d8eae709ebfd.mp3"}}],"words":